{"id":181246,"vol":{"id":27258,"name":"Doom Patrol"},"num":"4","name":"Dead Reckoning; The Coming of the... Clique!","title":"Doom Patrol #4","year":"2010","date":"2010-01-01","store":"2009-11-04","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/5/52045/1015299-dpa3_cv4_ds_copy.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/5/52045/1015299-dpa3_cv4_ds_copy.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"When BLACKEST NIGHT falls, skeletons start coming out of the closets - and no one has more skeletonsin his closet than Niles Caulder, founder of the Doom Patrol. Caulder has been playing god for years, and the time for a reckoning has come. The Doom Patrol thought they knew darkness. Find out how wrong they were in this BLACKEST NIGHT tie-in issue!\n\nMeanwhile, in the Metal Men co-feature, trendy meets grotesque when the robots battle a group of living mannequins.","people":[{"id":45080,"name":"Elisabeth V. Gehrlein","role":"editor"},{"id":4844,"name":"Guy Major","role":"colorist, cover"},{"id":41043,"name":"J.M. DeMatteis","role":"writer"},{"id":13761,"name":"John Livesay","role":"inker"},{"id":25534,"name":"Justiniano","role":"penciler, cover"},{"id":6536,"name":"Keith Giffen","role":"writer"},{"id":1785,"name":"Kevin Maguire","role":"penciler"},{"id":12505,"name":"Nick J. Napolitano","role":"letterer"},{"id":41785,"name":"Pat Brosseau","role":"letterer"},{"id":41782,"name":"Sean Ryan","role":"editor"}],"chars":[{"id":4079,"name":"Robotman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8791309-ezgif-2-890a6d35b0.jpg"},{"id":4087,"name":"Negative Man","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8791315-ezgif-2-f900911489.jpg"},{"id":13682,"name":"Mercury","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/10/100647/6024053-mercury2.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":55766,"name":"\"Green Lantern\" Blackest Night"}]}